        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>1) Suppose there is a +1 damage effect in play.&nbsp; Someone hits a hero for 2 points, increased to 3. That hero can re-direct the damage to another target.&nbsp; Would the damage be 3 or 4? My guess is 3 because the same damage is being re-directed.</p><p>2) But if the hero&#39;s effect was instead, &quot;when you take x damage, deal x damage to another target,&quot; would that then increase the damage to 4 because essentially a 3 point &quot;attack&quot; is being launched, which should increase to 4?</p><p>Sorry if this is confusing, but I&#39;ve realized it comes up more often than I would have thought.</p>",
