      {
        "id": 52672,
        "name": "johnomar",
        "username": "johnomar",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/9d8465/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-01-28T23:54:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I accept the official ruling, but what if the redirected damage is from a hero to his/her nemesis? I'm redirecting 4 damage to my nemesis...do I do 5 damage instead?</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
